1. more, less tools to navigate files
2. cat <filename> => display file in the terminal 
3. tac <filename> => display file from end to beginning 
4. fallocate -l <size> <filename> => to create a file with specifc size (((optional)))
5. gzip <file names> => compress file
6. gunzip <file name> => decompress file
7. tar -czf <filename> <files> => archieve some files
    c => create 
    f => file
    z => compress using gzip
8. tar -xf <filename> => unarchive file
    x => extract
    f => file
9. zcat => to display compressed file
10. > <filename> => to redirect stdoutput to a file
11. 2> <filename> => to redirect stderror to a file
12. >> <filename> => to append stdout to afile
13. 2>> <filenname> => to appnd stderror to a file
14. grep <pattern> <filename> => to search in a file
15. &> <filename> => redirect both stdout and stderror to a file
